  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By virtue of removing publically accessible cycle parking the proposal would fail to promote sustainable modes of transport, contrary to&amp;nbsp; London Plan Policies T1,T6 and Local Plan Policies P33 Policies LP42, LP45 and TR4 of the NPPF.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed advertisement, by reason of its scale, siting and appearance would result in an obtrusive and visually incongruous feature that contributes to an unsightly proliferation and clutter of signage and street furniture in the local area that would detract from the visual amenity of the street scene. As such, the proposal would be contrary to policies D4 (Delivering Good Design),&amp;nbsp; D8 (Public Realm) of the London Plan (2021) and policies PP1 (Public Realm), LP1 (High Quality Design) and LP7 (Advertisements) of Hackney&#x27;s Local Development Plan (2020).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
